        "heading": "Better skin and hair <em>start in the shower.</em>",
        "lead": "<p>The founder spent years trying every cream, mask and shampoo for skin that felt tight and hair that felt dull. Nothing lasted past lunch.</p>",
        "text": "<p>The change came from somewhere less obvious: the water. Chlorine is in the water you shower in, and it can strip skin and hair of their natural oils, leaving them dry, tight and dull. A simple filter on the showerhead made more difference than the whole shelf of products in the bathroom.</p><p>Most filters on the market were bulky, hid the cartridge, or looked like hardware. So the founder designed one in France, made to stay on display and to feel at home in a beautiful bathroom.</p><p>Inside, water passes through two stages. A PP cotton filter catches sediment and fine particles. Then a calcium sulfite cartridge helps reduce chlorine. Both are replaceable in minutes, with no tools and no plumber.</p><p>DOUCE is made for people who want better hair and healthier skin, starting with the water they shower in.</p>",
